Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix:=20complete=20MySQL=E2=86=92PostgreSQL=20mi?=
 =?UTF-8?q?gration?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- includes/payment.php: require_once 'config.php' → __DIR__/config.php (CRITICAL: was causing silent fatal errors on all pages except dashboard)
- includes/auth.php: is_active=TRUE, RETURNING id+fetchColumn, exam_required boolean fix (false→'false' string)
- includes/functions.php: is_active/is_online booleans, CURDATE→CURRENT_DATE, column_exists schema fix
- api/update_progress.php: ON DUPLICATE KEY → ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE, remove duplicate params
- api/rate_teacher.php: is_active=TRUE, ON DUPLICATE KEY → ON CONFLICT
- api/submit_correction.php: ON DUPLICATE KEY → ON CONFLICT
- api/upload_recitation.php: is_active=TRUE, RETURNING id+lastval()
- api/calls.php: RETURNING id+fetchColumn
- api/messages.php: RETURNING id+fetchColumn
- api/manage_group.php: is_active=TRUE
- admin/users.php: 1-is_active → NOT is_active, 1-has_star → NOT has_star
- admin/teachers.php: 1-has_star → NOT has_star, 1-exam_passed → NOT exam_passed
- admin/subscriptions.php: CURDATE → CURRENT_DATE
- call.php: MySQL IF() → CASE WHEN
- progress.php: SUM(condition) → COUNT FILTER (WHERE ...)
